{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_chen2_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_chen2_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"道路","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chen2_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"ee875db83de12c0272d9591f8b62d9abfdc33c5aa6d2a4a4d0c897876f5ed7aa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"饶命啊，陈女侠，我再也不敢了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神和你放在腰后面的手可不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地方不错，挺适合藏人的，准备了不少人吧？都出来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，不愧是陈女侠，弟兄们，都出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不够意思啊，老陈，打架怎么能不算我一个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这不是来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，老陈，我发现自从你去了罗德岛，越来越会说话了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了，一人一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这么多人一起上居然都不是你的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是特意演一出让我出手，又是埋伏，只是对付我一个，何必大费周章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你挡了太多人的财路了，陈女侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是不明白，你和林女侠现在是这座城市最热门的人物，又有市长给你们撑腰，只要你们想，钱和地位还不是抢着找你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不能乖乖去拍你的广告，上你的节目，非要来干这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己有钱不去赚，还要害我们赚不到钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不关你事，乖乖跟我去局子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，局子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"多索雷斯警察局的牢房冷清了这么些年，这一次倒是开张了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，陈女侠，你知不知道，只要我背后的人和那边打一声招呼，说不定你前脚刚走，我们就出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但这个教训你得给我记着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我记着呢，陈女侠你这么厉害，我怎么忘得了？嘻嘻嘻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，老陈，和他说这些说不通的，还不如打断他一只手，他就没功夫在这嘻嘻哈哈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会这么做，你也别想，虽然我现在没有立场要求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了吧，老陈，你不会以为我以前是因为你是我上司才听你的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过嘛，不打断他的手，堵住他的嘴总可以吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说着，星熊用绳子绕过罪犯的嘴，用力一捆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"咕唔唔唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随你的便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，把他们送到局子去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这帮人涉嫌破坏公共财物，以及蓄意袭击我，就交给你们处理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的多索雷斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？他们竟然敢袭击陈小姐你？这这这，请交给我们吧，我保证让他们吃足苦头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罪犯","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"唔咕咕咕！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"别给我使眼色了，惹了陈小姐，你背后有什么人都不好使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给他们应有的惩罚就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谄媚的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"行，您说什么就是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那边怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是我好不容易赚来的钱啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么能这么说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说了你能怎么着吧？你大爷我今天心情不好，不想坐牢就给我滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你......唉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"陈、陈小姐？没、没什么，这家伙在这无理取闹呢，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"陈女侠？！我可没有无理取闹！我本来存了一年的钱来参加比赛，这次比赛我稍微还赚了点，就一起存进了卡里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"然后上午的时候，我走在路上卡被人偷了，我就想找警察帮我抓小偷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他问了我存款数目后，就嘲笑我这点钱也来报案，让我滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"是，啊，不是，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪里可以看到城内无人机的监控？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？那个......局里就有，不过，很久没用过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"谢、谢谢你，陈女侠！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"房间里有点闷，两位见谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，钥匙给我，接下来交给我们就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的，那个，有用得着我的地方请尽管叫我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，这里的设备看起来真高级，比我们局里的都要先进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这地方一看就压根没人用，白瞎了这么好的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"局里的监控设备更新了吗？我走之前提过一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没呢，不过许可批下来了，估计接下来要折腾好一阵子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，能操作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用的是哥伦比亚的系统，看得懂。至于认证，啧，忘了把刚才那人留下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我试试......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈说着将自己的手机靠近了认证终端，清脆的通行提示音响起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，看来他们确实把权限都给我开放了，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是挺好，你要不然干脆在这儿再就业得了，这些人都听你的，不比在龙门干得顺心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，两位，我听不懂你们在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我们龙门来的，聊天的时候下意识地就会用回家乡话，别在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的，两位慢聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来放松了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，陈女侠您愿意帮我我就放心了，城里的人都知道您和这些警察不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"有您帮忙，就算最后没找到小偷，我也认了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，这种案子我和老陈处理过没有一千件，也有八百件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么时候在哪儿被偷的？最好具体一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"大概在十一点的时候，在诺克斯步行街中间那一段......就是有一间很大的酒吧前面的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是林雨霞那家酒吧的附近吗......你先在外面等着吧，我来帮你查，这里的东西你不能看太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你提供的线索很具体，就算监控没拍到，多半也有目击者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，那就拜托您了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说完，参赛选手走出监控室，在外面等待了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，不愧是老陈，走到哪里都被人信赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本来是这里的警察该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给他们做个榜样也不错不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也得他们愿意学。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来帮把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间段锁定在十点到十二点区间，我来看这两个摄像头，你看那两个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，老陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有句话我不知道当讲不当讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说这话的时候从来没有把话咽回去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。你刚才对那些不成器的家伙们说话的时候，很有范儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以前也这样给局里的人训话，习惯了，你说得对，是得改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你没听明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"局里人你知道底细，你训的都是他们确实应该去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这些人，你也知道他们的底细，但你却好像已经知道你无法改变他们，所以只让他们去做一些表面的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的陈警司，可不这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你别误会，我其实想说，这是好事，大大的好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阴阳怪气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可冤枉我了，哎，我看到外面那哥们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十点三十五分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有了。锁定这个人，找出他的行动轨迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"OK。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和他的同伙汇合了，看来他是附近帮派的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这不是最近风头正盛的陈女侠吗，有何贵干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":true,"text":"很难说有，也很难说没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我找个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈和星熊以及参赛选手来到和林雨霞约定的位置。\n在那里，林雨霞正百无聊赖地摆弄着手中的卡，而她的脚边，则躺着昏迷过去，被捆成一团的小偷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着，是你的卡没错吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，没错，就是这张卡，太谢谢您了，林女侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠你个人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了，顺手的事，而且我也没什么事用得到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":true,"text":"林雨霞，我就在店里换了三件衣服的功夫，你人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到一个老奶奶过马路很不方便，就去扶了她一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这里是商场五楼！你从哪里能看到老奶奶啊，而且楼下是步行街！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":true,"text":"限你五分钟之内出现，否则你死定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者你可以替我去帮诗怀雅扛她的购物袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还是算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就没事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人就交给你处置了，回见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，不管看几次都觉得怪不可思议的，老陈你居然能和林小姐搞好关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她这算搞好了关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好保管你的卡，别再丢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"一定，一定。真是不知道该怎么感谢两位还有林女侠才好，为了我这样的人居然做到这份上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为警察，本来就该保障市民的安全和利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"两位都是警察吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以前是，她现在是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，要是这座城市里的警察都能像您说的那样就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不是警察，作为一个人，帮助另一个人也是应该的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也是这么想的，但是来到这座城市后，感觉又好像不是这样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是本地人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，不如说，这里大部分像我一样的打工仔都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我家原本在辛嘉斯政府管辖的一座村子里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次辛嘉斯和真正玻利瓦尔人起了冲突，结果我们整个村子都被真正玻利瓦尔人给毁了，死了不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我运气好，当时在山上打猎，逃过一劫，结果回来看到村子变成那样就跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"本来想当兵，但是军队不要我，我最后没办法，听说这里好赚钱，就跑来了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，提起你的伤心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"......老实说，您说提到我的伤心事，但我自己回想起过去，现在都感觉好像在做梦一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我今年三十五，在家乡的村子生活了二十多年，来到这里才不到十年，但我有时候会觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"会觉得过去的生活好像是假的一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也觉得帮别人是对的事情，但是刚才听您这么说，我却感觉好像很久没听人说过，而我自己也很久没有产生过这样的想法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，如果当时在警局那边，我不是向警察求救的那个，而是像您一样在旁边看着的那个，我一定不会去帮那个求救的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己其实也知道那样没用，就是气不过，本来也没想着他们真的会帮我，没想到遇上了您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"在这座城市里，有钱就是能办成很多事，没钱就不要指望事能办成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"想翻身就去碰运气，去参加帮派、去赌、去抢，只想着努力工作赚工资的都是傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"参加大奖赛也是碰运气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是，我胆子小，不敢赌，也不敢抢，对我这种人来说，参加大奖赛就是最稳妥的赚大钱的法子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这种不指望赢的，只要能海选出线就赚了，要是第一轮还能赢，说不定还能混点名气，赚得更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我在一家餐厅打工，我和老板说一声，请两位还有林小姐在店里吃一顿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，怎么说，干脆把Missy也叫上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我这就回去和老板说一声，要是知道陈林两位女侠要光临他的餐厅，他也一定很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"参赛选手","speakerId":"avg_npc_205","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，老陈，不把人送回去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帮我个忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这可真是太阳打西边出来了。事先声明，没钱，我还要找Missy借钱呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，不逗你了。说吧，就冲着这些年来，我第一次从你嘴里听到这句话，无论什么忙，我都帮你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"什么女侠，不就是仗着自己有市长撑腰，还真把自己当回事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是有市长撑腰我也做得到啊，嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那个，这个，您回来了，陈小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，那个，您背后的这个人就是小偷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，交给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，没问题，惹到陈小姐头上，我一定让他吃点苦头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"您还有什么吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚去和坎黛拉女士说了一件事，就是，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐的意思是，她也知道自己太显眼，让你们局子在坎黛拉女士面前有点没面子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她刚才特意去找了一趟坎黛拉女士，希望提高这边局里的绩效和奖金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士看在我们陈小姐的面子上，特批了一笔资金，只要局里的人有实绩，就会有奖金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐还会开课和带队，给大家传授一些她过去作为警察时抓捕罪犯的方法与技巧，让大家能更好地赢取坎黛拉女士为大家准备的奖金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以问一下，奖金有多少吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一桩案子，这个数。"},{"type":"narration","text":"星熊用手指在对方面前比划了一个数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"......陈、陈小姐，您真是个了不起的人！我这就去告诉其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这个人就算在你头上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐烦的多索雷斯警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢、谢谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是感觉很难受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能说很好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，既然你问我，“怎么样才能让这里的警察至少能够动起来”，那么这就是我能给出的最简单直接的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这样......还是不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，这样不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以给你很多理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，你初来乍到，即使你有超强的人格魅力，也很难马上服众，你可以回想一下你当年刚进局里的时候花了多久让那帮刺头都服你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候，用利益让人来服从你是最简单的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没记错的话，我是把他们挨个打服的，你是最后一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，当你明明拥有某种东西却不去使用时，所谓依靠自己的力量往往只是一种傲慢的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是当那些东西是财产，权力，地位这些的时候，你还不如就那么去使用它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我过去也给人这样的感觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用自己多年的努力让龙门没有人这么认为了，但这里不是龙门，而你也不会在这里停留那么久，你怎么证明自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再者，刚才他发的牢骚你我听得一清二楚，这里的警察变成这样你真的觉得是因为他们不想履行自己的义务吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就天生混账？他们觉得和帮派企业勾结天经地义？他们被一通电话就要放人心里也乐呵着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里还叫警察局呢，他们知道自己是警察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不是不想，是不能，是不敢，他们可能有过勇气，但也被现实磨平了，任何大道理对他们来说都毫无意义，还不如用最直接的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是理由，而你也确实应该说，你这样不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你做了，这是事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，但你还不够清楚，老陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是过去，我害怕你会死在毫无意义的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，你离开龙门后确实变了一些，而且，至少从我的角度看来，是好的变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我反过来又有些害怕你会迷失自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说的有点太多了，不管我怎么害怕，这都是你自己的决定，我不会干涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定不会再拦在我的面前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唷，还记仇呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这可确实不好说，你知道，我这个人，可没有那么把誓言当回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，星熊不把誓言当回事，这个笑话倒是很新奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不知道怎么回答你，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像我依然不知道该如何以我来评判刚才的事，评判这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恐怕只能先走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就够了，老陈，这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我说的挺吓人，但你还是不要忘了，你身边有很多人，你不懂的话，是可以向他们请教的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那接下来的开课，你来主讲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是现役警察，我又不是，而且你不是说，我应该多向身边的人请教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，我当学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，你都这么说了，那我还能拒绝不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要叫上Missy，不能只有我一个人受这个罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随你，你叫上林雨霞都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好好的度假就这么没咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实在的，这座城市的太阳太刺眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是挺刺眼的，我也觉得。但那至少是太阳啊，老陈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
